## 🛠️ Quick Start

### 1. Clone and Setup
```bash
git clone <repository-url>
cd {{.ProjectName | lower}}
make setup
```

### 2. Generate Protocol Buffer Code
```bash
make generate
```

### 3. Run the Service
```bash
# Development mode with hot reload
make dev

# Or build and run manually
make build
make run
```

The service will start on:
- gRPC server: `localhost:{{.GrpcPort}}`{{if .MetricsEnabled}}
- Metrics endpoint: `http://localhost:{{.MetricsPort}}/metrics`{{end}}
- Health check: `http://localhost:{{.MetricsPort}}/health`

## 🏗️ Architecture

This service follows modern microservice patterns:

```
{{.ProjectName}}
├── cmd/server/           # Application entry point
├── internal/
│   ├── config/          # Configuration management
│   ├── server/          # gRPC server implementation
│   ├── services/        # Business logic layer
│   ├── interceptors/    # gRPC middleware{{if ne .DatabaseDriver ""}}
│   ├── database/        # Database connection and migrations
│   ├── models/          # Data models
│   ├── repository/      # Data access layer{{end}}{{if ne .AuthType ""}}
│   ├── auth/            # Authentication and authorization{{end}}{{if .TracingEnabled}}
│   ├── observability/   # Tracing and monitoring{{end}}{{if ne .ServiceDiscovery ""}}
│   ├── discovery/       # Service discovery{{end}}
│   └── logger/          # Logging interface
├── proto/               # Protocol Buffer definitions
├── configs/             # Configuration files
├── tests/               # Test suites
└── docs/                # Documentation
```

## 🔧 Configuration

Configuration is managed through YAML files and environment variables:

```yaml
# configs/config.dev.yaml
server:
  grpc_port: {{.GrpcPort}}
  metrics_port: {{.MetricsPort}}
  
logging:
  level: "info"
  format: "json"{{if ne .DatabaseDriver ""}}

database:
  driver: "{{.DatabaseDriver}}"
  host: "localhost"
  port: 5432
  name: "{{.ProjectName | lower}}"{{end}}{{if .TracingEnabled}}

tracing:
  enabled: true
  service_name: "{{.ProjectName | lower}}"{{end}}{{if .MetricsEnabled}}

metrics:
  enabled: true
  path: "/metrics"{{end}}
```

### Environment Variables

| Variable | Description | Default |
|----------|-------------|---------|
| `CONFIG_FILE` | Configuration file path | `configs/config.dev.yaml` |
| `LOG_LEVEL` | Logging level | `info` |
| `GRPC_PORT` | gRPC server port | `{{.GrpcPort}}` |
| `METRICS_PORT` | Metrics server port | `{{.MetricsPort}}` |{{if ne .DatabaseDriver ""}}
| `DB_HOST` | Database host | `localhost` |
| `DB_PORT` | Database port | Database-specific |
| `DB_NAME` | Database name | `{{.ProjectName | lower}}` |
| `DB_USER` | Database user | `{{.ProjectName | lower}}` |
| `DB_PASSWORD` | Database password | Required for production |{{end}}{{if eq .AuthType "jwt"}}
| `JWT_SECRET` | JWT signing secret | Required |
| `JWT_EXPIRY` | JWT token expiry | `24h` |{{end}}

