## 🔐 Security{{if ne .AuthType ""}}

### Authentication
This service uses {{.AuthType | upper}} authentication:

{{if eq .AuthType "jwt"}}#### JWT Authentication
```bash
# Include JWT token in requests
grpcurl -plaintext \
  -H "authorization: Bearer <jwt-token>" \
  localhost:{{.GrpcPort}} {{.ProjectName | lower}}.v1.{{.ProjectName}}Service/Method
```{{end}}

{{if eq .AuthType "mtls"}}#### Mutual TLS (mTLS)
```bash
# Configure client certificates
grpcurl -cert client.crt -key client.key \
  -cacert ca.crt \
  localhost:{{.GrpcPort}} {{.ProjectName | lower}}.v1.{{.ProjectName}}Service/Method
```{{end}}

{{if eq .AuthType "oauth2"}}#### OAuth2 Authentication
```bash
# Include OAuth2 token
grpcurl -plaintext \
  -H "authorization: Bearer <oauth2-token>" \
  localhost:{{.GrpcPort}} {{.ProjectName | lower}}.v1.{{.ProjectName}}Service/Method
```{{end}}{{end}}

### Security Best Practices
- TLS encryption for all communications
- Input validation and sanitization
- Rate limiting and request throttling
- Secure configuration management
- Regular security audits

